## Phase 2: Green (Implementation)

Made the following changes:

1. Updated mobile/src/app/setup.tsx:
   - Added import: import { useHeaderHeight } from "expo-router/react-navigation";
   - Added hook call: const headerHeight = useHeaderHeight();
   - Added keyboardVerticalOffset prop: keyboardVerticalOffset={headerHeight}

2. Updated mobile/src/app/settings.tsx:
   - Added import: import { useHeaderHeight } from "expo-router/react-navigation";
   - Added hook call: const headerHeight = useHeaderHeight();
   - Added keyboardVerticalOffset prop: keyboardVerticalOffset={headerHeight}

3. Updated mobile/src/app-routing/keyboardHandling.test.ts:
   - Added test: "setup.tsx uses useHeaderHeight and passes keyboardVerticalOffset={headerHeight} to account for the Stack header"
   - Added test: "settings.tsx uses useHeaderHeight and passes keyboardVerticalOffset={headerHeight} to account for the Stack header"

